  "narrative": {
    "text": "**Business & market dynamics:** AI-related services are the primary growth engine, offsetting persistent headwinds in the Trust & Safety segment. Revenue exceeded expectations, reflecting healthy demand for next-generation digital offerings, but management’s forward guidance landed modestly below consensus, signaling near‑term caution in the traditional business mix.\n\n**Management strategy and execution:** An interim CFO presided over an earnings beat, demonstrating operational discipline. However, the softer revenue outlook points to a guarded stance, likely acknowledging the uneven demand environment. No new capital allocation or organizational restructuring signals emerged, leaving the narrative focused on how AI‑driven momentum can sustain the top line as legacy pressures persist.",
